- **system_info**: Retrieve system information including OS, kernel, uptime, CPU, memory, and disk usage.
Use this INSTEAD of shell_exec with uname, hostname, uptime, free, df, lscpu, /proc/meminfo, /proc/cpuinfo, Get-ComputerInfo, or systeminfo commands.
Prefer this tool for any system overview or health check request.
